flowchart TD
    subgraph IngestionPipeline [Ingestion Pipeline]
        DocIntake[Document Intake]
        DocChunker[Document Chunker]
        DocIntake --> DocChunker
    end

    subgraph StrategyRegistry [Chunker Strategy Registry]
        CS[Chunking Strategy]
        FSC[Fixed Size Chunker]
        SenC[Sentence Chunker]
        ParC[Paragraph Chunker]

        FSC -.->|implements| CS
        SenC -.->|implements| CS
        ParC -.->|implements| CS
    end

    DocChunker -->|delegates to| CS

    subgraph Metadata [Metadata Extractor]
        ME[Metadata Extractor Component]
    end

    CS -->|returns raw chunks| ME

    subgraph IndexerTiers [Hierarchical Indexer Tiers]
        IB[Index Backend]
        IMI[In-Memory Vector Index]
        Persistent[Persistent Index Tier]

        IMI -.->|implements| IB
        Persistent -.->|implements| IB
    end

    ME -->|enriched chunks| IB
